msgstr "# gmirror status\n      Name    Status  Components\nmirror/gm0  DEGRADED  ada1 (ACTIVE)\n                      ada0 (SYNCHRONIZING, 64%)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/geom/_index.adoc:590
